<section class="bench" aria-labelledby="benchTitle">
 <div class="eyebrow">Interactive training bench • simulated only</div>
 <h2 id="benchTitle">Build a fault. Test the circuit.</h2>
 <p>Choose a fault and switch condition. Select RED or BLACK, then click any labeled test point. The colored leads follow your probe placements and the virtual meter updates. All values are illustrative training examples—not vehicle specifications.</p>
 <div class="bench-controls">
