 <p class="note">Safety and scope: this is a simplified low-voltage teaching model. The short-to-ground option represents a protective fuse opening in the simulation; it does not model real fault energy. Never use simulated values as pass/fail limits or apply this diagram to a vehicle without its wiring diagram and OEM procedure. Resistance/continuity modes require battery negative to be disconnected in this simulation; the switch may remain closed once the circuit is isolated.</p>
